                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\nrequire(\"evi_biquad.genexpr\");\r\n\r\n/*\n    filter  calculator                              \tparameters\n    0       bypass                                  \tnone\n\t1\t\teviBiquadCoeffHighpassGain \t\t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t2\t\teviBiquadCoeffLowShelf \t\t\t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t3\t\teviBiquadCoeffLowShelfCookbook \t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t4\t\teviBiquadCoeffLowShelfAnalog \t\t\t\tcutoff, gain\n\t5\t\teviBiquadCoeffPeakNotch         (default)   cutoff, gain, Q\n\t6\t\teviBiquadCoeffPeakNotchAnalog \t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t7\t\teviBiquadCoeffNotchGain \t\t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t8\t\teviBiquadCoeffHighShelf \t\t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t9\t\teviBiquadCoeffHighShelfCookbook \t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t10\t\teviBiquadCoeffHighShelfAnalog \t\t\t\tcutoff, gain\n\t11\t\teviBiquadCoeffLowpassGain \t\t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n\t12\t\teviBiquadCoeffAllpassGain \t\t\t\t\tcutoff, gain, Q\n*/\nParam   filter(5, min=0, max=12);\r\nfilt    = int(filter);\r\nreset   = delta(change(filt)) < 0;\r\n\r\na0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffEQ(filt, in2, dbtoa(in3), in4);\r\n\r\nout1    = biquadDf2reset(in1, a0, a1, a2, b1, b2, reset);\r\n\r\n",
